    kind: work_item  # 677b
    title: "elixir: six Phoenix/Plug response SENDERS are declared net_recv — they mint untrusted_input at a call that emits AND leave the egress unregistered as a sink"  # 677b
    status: todo_hard  # 677b
    priority: 2  # 677b
    parent:  # 677b
